window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Contains all 4 books of the Building 402 series</p> <p>Adjacent</p> <p>He’s the last guy she should be checking for. Arrogant. Sexy. A Certified F*ckboy.</p> <p>She’s the only girl he can’t seem to get off his mind. Ambitious. Attractive. Adjacent.</p> <p>Being neighbors doesn’t help their causes. And when one side folds to their curiosity about the person next door, it quickly becomes clear that anything goes in B402.</p> <p>Replacement</p> <p>Angie is taking a serious break from dating.</p> <p>At least, she thought she was until she comes across the finest man she’s ever seen—the new handyman in her building.</p> <p>Angie knows what she wants in a man, and Law doesn't seem to be it. But that doesn’t mean she can’t get to know him, right?</p> <p>Law is focused on rebuilding his life as a free man.</p> <p>That rebuild doesn’t include getting involved with anyone, especially not the bougie girl at his job who always needs something fixed. But when Angie proves there’s more to her than what meets the eye, Law learns he’ll be doing a lot more than just handiwork in B402.</p> <p>Displacement</p> <p>He’s her only option. Her best friend. The one she can always count on. The one she... might have a crush on.</p> <p>She’s the last girl he should be checking for. His best friend. The one who desperately needs a place to stay after being displaced by a fire. The one who’s always had a piece of his heart.</p> <p>While Monte and Nicole have always been respectful of the boundaries within their friendship, something about B402 has a way of shaking the table. Complacent Shayne can’t wait to see her husband.</p> <p>With their anniversary a day away, she has all bases covered when it comes to their celebration. But when things don’t go as planned, and accidents turn into arguments, she can’t help but wonder if the 3-year itch has snuck its way into their marriage.</p> <p>While thoughts of complacency are looming for Shayne, Danny knows his gift to his wife is bound to shake things up. But when he also receives a huge surprise, the couple realizes it may be time to say bye...to B402.</p>"; 
